    fullText: "na Si fs RAR EINE oe\n\now\n\n~MALACANANG\n8 Manila *\n\nBY THE PRESIDENT OF\n\neee\n\nTHE PHILIPPINES 1\nEXECUTIVE ORDER NO. 648:\n\nATTACHING THE NATIONAL TELECOMMUNICATIONS COMMISSION\nFROM THE DEPARTMENT OF TRANSPORTATION \u201cAND\nCOMMUNICATIONS (DOTC) TO -THE\u00ab<. COMMISSION \u201cON\nINFORMATION AND COMMUNICATIONS TECHNOLOGY (CICT)>\n\nWHEREAS, the National Telecommunications Commissig: (N7C) is\nattached to the Department of Transportation and Communicatiogs; eS\n\nWHEREAS, Section 20, Chapter 7, Title I, Book IN] of EO 292\n(Administrative Code of 1987) provides that the President has the continuing\nauthority to reorganize the Executive Branch of government;\n\nNOW, THEREFORE, I, GLORIA MACAPAGAL-ARROYO, Presicient of\nthe Republic of the Philippines, by virtue of the powers vested in me by law, do\nhereby order:\n\nSECTION 1. The National Telecommunications Commission is hereby\nattached from the Department of Transportation and-Communications to the\nCommission on Information \u2018and Communications Technology,\n\nSECTION 2. All executive issuances, rules and reguiations, or parts\nthereof, inconsistent with this Executive Order dre hereby repealed, amended or\nmodified accordingly.\n\nSECTION 3. This Executive Oras shall take effect immediately upon its\npublication in a national nawspaper of general circulation.\n\nDONE in the City of Manila, this 6th dayof August in the\nyear of Our Lord, Two Thousand and Seven. 7\n\nve vi fea .\nBy the President: @\n\nf-\n\nEDUA.DO -\u2014 ~ERMITA\nExecutive oucretary\n\nLente\n\n<a",
